# Simulation ownership

Persistent world, jump snapshots, and landing outcomes live here. Data may flow to rendering; meshes, materials, cameras, and instance IDs must not become authority for a later jump.

Cover behavior with deterministic tests and readout scripts that use the same resolver a player click uses. Do not fabricate capture-only populations.

Deep time resolves a landing directly. Do not add year-by-year playback.

A new field needs a resolver that writes it and a named consumer that changes an outcome.
